 Dependabot merged PRs in batches at the start of
the day, triggering simultaneous Docker image builds that overwhelmed
Jenkins master-to-slave HTTP communication and caused widespread job hangs;

 the outdated JJB fork rejected Pipeline definitions
at deploy time, making it impossible to adopt any Jenkins feature released in
the past two years;

